74
00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:14.430
Natuke paremal aastal.

75
00:10:20.920 --> 00:10:23.760
Palved hind igaks.

76
00:10:23.860 --> 00:10:25.829
Alla.

77
00:10:25.929 --> 00:10:29.410
Euro on liiter ikka 70 senti.
Need kolm jagavad

78
00:10:29.620 --> 00:10:32.890
selle kolm koma midagi 3,2 3,3

79
00:10:33.760 --> 00:10:35.400
seepi.

80
00:10:35.500 --> 00:10:37.770
Kolm euri on kall, on,

81
00:10:37.870 --> 00:10:41.100
