100
00:24:53.270 --> 00:24:55.570
Tule natuke siia, siiapoole veel.

101
00:24:55.670 --> 00:24:57.820
Nii, nüüd astu,
astu natuke pikem samm,

102
00:24:57.920 --> 00:25:00.400
