103
00:25:00.500 --> 00:25:03.390
Aju tekitab ise visuaale.

104
00:25:03.490 --> 00:25:06.269
Ja.

105
00:25:06.369 --> 00:25:08.280
Ja siis ma hakkasin mõtlema, et,
et noh,

106
